    "updated_at": "2018-06-14T20:41:43Z",
    "body": ">  E.g., if you put two same-origin tabs in the same agent cluster, they can suddenly share memory, even if they cannot synchronously access each other.\r\n\r\nHow would this happen? It doesn't seem to fit with the current definition of agent cluster.",
