    "created_at": "2018-06-25T19:06:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-06-25T19:06:51Z",
    "body": "I'm not too worried myself. I think we should indeed strive to get the agent cluster definition correct, but if we don't, the natural process boundaries in implementations will lead us to discover the mismatch pretty quickly. (As long as we maintain the usual discipline for writing tests and such.)",
